To share Design Tokens across styled-components or Emotion, you wrap the React tree in a specialized context. Fill in the blank to complete the package import and component application:

```jsx
import React from 'react';
import { [blank] } from 'styled-components';

const theme = { colors: { brand: '#0070f3' } };

function App() {
  return (
    <[blank] theme={theme}>
       <MainLayout />
    </[blank]>
  );
}
```
